# ========================================================
# MARGINALIA // CLOUD DATABASE (SUPABASE) CONFIGURATION
# ========================================================
# To connect to a live Supabase project across all devices:
# 1. Create a project at https://supabase.com
# 2. In Project Settings > API, copy Project URL and Project API anon key
# 3. Create a '.env' file in the root folder with these values:

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here
